🇮🇷| ‌Qalibaf: The US was supposed to lift the US navy blockade within 30 days, but Trump then said he will lift the blockade tonight. 

If there had been no negotiation, this would not have happened, and if there were no missiles, my words at the negotiation table would have been considered bluff and lies.

